<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Tobacco 1996 net down 38.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Tobacco 1996 net down 38.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 196</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  25.50   vs	  41.39</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 12.6    vs	  20.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   537.72   vs	 537.28</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    37.43   vs	  62.70</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	31.0    vs	  31.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian Tobacco Company Bhd maufactures tobacco and cigarettes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
